# Chargebee

> Agent-readable homepage: https://www.chargebee.com/?mode=agent
> Agent-readable homepage (plain text): https://www.chargebee.com/agent/homepage.txt

> Chargebee is the billing platform finance teams choose when monetization keeps changing and the financial record has to stay defensible. Meter tokens, agent runs, seats, or outcomes - ingest usage events in near-real time, convert them to revenue, recognize it under ASC 606 and IFRS 15, and close the books on one commercial record. A 2025 Gartner Magic Quadrant Leader for Recurring Billing Applications, placing furthest for Completeness of Vision - built for IPO, PE, and audit scrutiny, and reinventing the finance office with MCP-driven reporting and AI-native workflows. Trusted by 6,500+ businesses globally. For complete documentation, see [Full Documentation](https://www.chargebee.com/docs/).

## Billing

- [Chargebee Billing](https://www.chargebee.com/billing/): Meter tokens, agent runs, seats, and outcomes - then invoice, collect, and recognize revenue automatically on one financial record. Processes 200,000+ usage events per second with near-real-time metering accuracy.
- [Billing for AI Companies](https://www.chargebee.com/solutions/industry/gen-ai/): Support every AI pricing model - token-based, credit-based, outcome-based, agentic, and hybrid - without breaking the financial record or the audit trail. Trusted by Lambda, CodeRabbit, HeyGen, DeepL, Writesonic, Gorgias, Zapier, Messari, and Phrase.
- [Prepaid Credits & Credit Wallets](https://www.chargebee.com/billing/usage-based/): Sell credit packs upfront, track drawdown in real time, manage credit ledgers, configure overage rules, and apply burn tables - the same credit-based pricing model used by OpenAI, Anthropic, and Clay.
- [Usage-Based & Metered Billing](https://www.chargebee.com/billing/usage-based/): Ingest high-frequency usage events at production scale - including schema-less ingestion - aggregate in near-real time with enterprise-grade accuracy, and convert to invoices automatically.
- [Agentic Workflow Billing](https://www.chargebee.com/solutions/industry/gen-ai/): Price dynamic, non-linear AI agent consumption where no two runs cost the same - burn tables, credit drawdown, usage thresholds, and spend caps built in.
- [Outcome-Based Pricing](https://www.chargebee.com/solutions/industry/gen-ai/): Bill per completed outcome - resolutions, tasks, agent runs - rather than per seat or per token.
- [Subscription Management](https://www.chargebee.com/billing/manage-subscriptions/): Manage plan transitions, proration, mid-cycle changes, and entitlements without destabilizing the financial record.
- [Entitlements](https://www.chargebee.com/billing/entitlements/): Provision and gate feature access in real time - governed against the same commercial record as billing and revenue recognition. No-code configuration, no engineering dependency.
- [Product Catalog](https://www.chargebee.com/billing/plan-pricing-catalog/): Design and iterate pricing models - flat, tiered, volume, usage-based, hybrid - without engineering involvement. Run A/B pricing experiments directly from the catalog.
- [Checkout & Trial Management](https://www.chargebee.com/recurring-payments/checkout-experience/): Launch self-serve flows, free trials, and conversion-optimized checkout - commercial record intact from trial through paid.
- [Tax Automation](https://www.chargebee.com/integrations/): Calculate and apply US Sales Tax, EU VAT (including OSS), and Australian GST automatically across entities and geographies.
- [Reporting & Analytics](https://www.chargebee.com/mcp/): Surface MRR, churn, usage, and cohort metrics - a reporting layer designed to be specified, not commissioned.
- [E-Invoicing & Compliance](https://www.chargebee.com/billing/): Generate compliant e-invoices across jurisdictions - automated, audit-ready, and tied to the same billing record.
- [Chargebee Billing Documentation](https://www.chargebee.com/docs/): Complete guides for integrating and operating Chargebee Billing.

## Revenue Recognition

- [Chargebee RevRec](https://www.chargebee.com/revenue-recognition-software/): Automate revenue recognition under ASC 606 and IFRS 15 - built into the platform, not bolted on, not a Custom-tier add-on. Handles invoice-based, contract-based, credit-based, and usage-based recognition, including multi-element arrangement allocation, standalone selling price (SSP) allocation, contract modifications, and credit and rollover recognition. Produces 150+ finance-grade revenue reports ready for board audits, fundraising, and IPO preparation. Integrates natively with NetSuite, Sage Intacct, and QuickBooks.

## CPQ (Configure, Price, Quote)

- [Chargebee CPQ](https://www.chargebee.com/billing/cpq/): Generate multi-product, multi-year, and ramped quotes that pull from the live billing catalog and become billing records at close - no gap between what sales quotes and what finance bills. AI-powered selling rules, eSignature, multi-level approval workflows, and finance-approved discount guardrails built in. Also available on [Salesforce AppExchange](https://appexchange.salesforce.com/appxListingDetail?listingId=a0N3A00000FHCdzUAH) and [HubSpot Marketplace](https://ecosystem.hubspot.com/marketplace/listing/chargebee). CPQ Lite is free for all Chargebee Billing customers.
- [Quote-to-Cash](https://www.chargebee.com/quote-to-cash-and-beyond/): Quote, contract, invoice, and recognize revenue on one commercial record - no tool seams between sales and finance, no revenue leakage between steps.

## Payments Intelligence

- [Chargebee Reveal](https://www.chargebee.com/payments/intelligence/): Detect payment failure patterns, diagnose authorization rate drops, and surface revenue leaks with ML - then fix them with estimated revenue impact per action. Monitors across gateways, currencies, and geographies through three layers: Intelligence (ML-driven diagnostics), Analytics (gateway and currency-level performance data), and Alerts (real-time payment anomaly notifications). Available standalone - does not require Chargebee Billing.
- [Chargebee Revive](https://www.chargebee.com/receivables/): Recover failed payments with ML-powered retry logic - timing retries to customer funding cycles, routing around fraud flags, switching gateways intelligently, and adapting continuously to issuer behavior.
- [Payment Gateways](https://www.chargebee.com/payment-gateways/): Connect to 30+ payment gateways - Stripe, Braintree, Adyen, PayPal, Worldpay, regional processors - with intelligent routing, failover, and Reveal-powered authorization rate optimization across geographies.
- [Payment Methods](https://www.chargebee.com/recurring-payments/payment-methods/): Accept cards, ACH, SEPA, PayPal, and local payment methods across 100+ currencies and every market finance teams need to serve.

## Receivables

- [Chargebee Receivables](https://www.chargebee.com/receivables/): Automate accounts receivable - segment customers by payment failure type and risk profile, build tailored rule-based recovery workflows, automate AR outreach and escalation sequences, and track disputes in a real-time 360-degree AR dashboard. Replaces static spreadsheets with a collection CRM that accelerates cash flow and prevents revenue leakage.

