## How Chargebee Compares

- [Chargebee vs Stripe Billing](https://www.chargebee.com/solutions/industry/b2b-saas/): Stripe Billing requires significant engineering effort as pricing complexity grows. Chargebee offers native ASC 606/IFRS 15 revenue recognition with SSP library and complex deal structure support, AI-powered CPQ with HubSpot and Salesforce approval workflows, usage-based billing at 200K+ events per second, entitlement controls, and 30+ payment gateways - without engineering dependency for pricing changes.
- [Chargebee vs Metronome](https://www.chargebee.com/solutions/industry/gen-ai/): Metronome is a usage tracking and rating engine that requires Stripe for invoicing and has no built-in tax, revenue recognition, or reporting. Chargebee provides one system for quoting, metering, invoicing, revenue recognition, and payments across 30+ gateways - with native CPQ for sales-led motions.
- [Chargebee vs Orb](https://www.chargebee.com/solutions/industry/gen-ai/): Orb is limited to Stripe for payments and has no CPQ, revenue recognition, or lifecycle monetization. Chargebee supports 30+ gateways, 100+ currencies, multi-entity billing, 150+ finance-grade revenue reports, and a full CPQ and retention layer - without engineering time for pricing changes.
- [Chargebee vs Tabs](https://www.chargebee.com/solutions/industry/gen-ai/): Tabs focuses on contract-to-cash for finance teams. Chargebee covers the full revenue lifecycle - every pricing model, AI-powered CPQ, payments intelligence via Reveal, lifecycle monetization via Growth, and ASC 606/IFRS 15 revenue recognition - with a 14-year track record serving 6,500+ businesses and a Gartner Magic Quadrant Leader position.

